---
/**
 * src/components/Experience.astro
 * Experience Component
 *
 * Author: Edward Silva
 * Creation Date: 16 March, 2026
 * Last Update: 24 August, 2026
 *
 * Displays professional work experience as a stacked list using Summary text
 * on site list surfaces, with skills linked into the page's skills index.
 *
 * File Structure:
 * - Data Filtering: Functions to filter and sort experience entries
 * - List Rendering: Component to display experience entries with accessible markup
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - Rendered on home page in src/pages/index.astro
 *
 * Usage:
 * $ `npm run dev` : Rendered as part of index page template
